[{"answer":"Good morning, please take a seat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm thinking of buying a new car and I'd like some advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Had you got any particular make in mind?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm interested in a Lida,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had one before and liked it but haven't really made up my mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. We've got various models.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the engine size? Any ideas?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Er... the one I've got at the moment's a 1.2 litre engine but","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I find it a bit slow on long journeys.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like a bit more power this time...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"a 1.4 should do,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I need a 1.6 or anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think the model you're looking at is the Max.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Here's a picture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"have you got one in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll take you to have a look at it in a minute.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just get a few more details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there anything else to do with the engine?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"What kind of gear change do you want?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I presume you'd want a manual?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd want automatic -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never driven a car with manual gears.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well now, here's the colour chart for the Max.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you given that any thought?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"This blue's very popular at the moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is nice, I like blue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm... what's it called? 'Royal'?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"But actually, I think I prefer this lighter shade here - 'Sky'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's popular too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll go for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"You might have to wait a week or so for that colour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"but I assume that'd be okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we can go outside and you can have a good look at one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and perhaps take it out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"But first, can I just ask you about finance?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"The cash price is going to be somewhere in the region of 7500.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"How would you like to pay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you in a position to pay cash, or would you need credit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like credit provided the terms are reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well you can discuss that with my colleague in a moment;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"we have various arrangements.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And would you be interested in us taking your present car as part exchange?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"So I'll just need some details from you and then we can do a valuation...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I have your full name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Wendy Harries,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"that's HARRIES.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/59.mp3"},{"answer":"And is that Mrs..?. Miss...? Ms...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Doctor, actually.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And your address?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/63.mp3"},{"answer":"20 Green Banks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that 'Green' spelled as in the colour?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Alton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that OLTON?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Not quite, it begins with an A, not an O.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes, that's in Hampshire isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/71.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/72.mp3"},{"answer":"And do you know your postcode?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. It's GU89EW.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have a daytime phone number?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I work at a hospital but it's a bit difficult to get hold of me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I can give you a number just for messages,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/77.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I'll get back to you when I can. Is that okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/78.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/79.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 0798257643.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/81.mp3"},{"answer":"And about the car you have now, what make is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/82.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a Conti.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know the year or the model name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/84.mp3"},{"answer":"I think it's 1996, and it's called a Lion - like the animal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Then it must be 1994, because they brought out the Fox after that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Mileage? Roughly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/88.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm not sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I know it's less than 70,000.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/90.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/91.mp3"},{"answer":"What colour is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/92.mp3"},{"answer":"It's grey, metallic grey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/93.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, and one last thing -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/94.mp3"},{"answer":"what sort of condition would you say it's in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/95.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd probably describe it as reasonable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/96.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you need to see it? It's parked outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/97.mp3"},{"answer":"Not at the moment, no.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/98.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps you could call in one day next week...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-5-test-3-part-1-2023-08-08-20-14-33/99.mp3"}]
